NAME
  selfcheck - run Freax in-game regression and memory checks

SYNOPSIS
  lua /selfcheck.lua

DESCRIPTION
  selfcheck validates selected libraries, shell behavior, events, threads,
  filesystems, process groups, signals, credentials, commands, and child exit
  status on a running OpenComputers machine.

  Output is grouped by subsystem. Optional tests print SKIP with a reason when
  root access or writable temporary storage is unavailable. A successful run
  prints check and skip totals plus free memory before requires, after requires,
  and at completion.

  First failure prints section and test, writes /tmp/s_fail.txt or /s_fail.txt
  when possible, and exits 1. Success removes stale failure markers and exits 0.

NOTES
  Host LuaJIT proves syntax only. It cannot test OpenComputers scheduling,
  hardware, terminal behavior, filesystem proxies, or credential enforcement.

  Reboot before testing kernel, init, or shared-runtime changes.

FILES
  /selfcheck.lua
  /tmp/s_fail.txt
  /s_fail.txt
